message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "ZORAN's Jobs"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, falsifiable skill runtime, and an oracle providing a
  coherent stop-criterion for autonomous agent loops — a "brain" layer
  pluggable into existing agentic frameworks (LangGraph, CrewAI, AutoGen)
  without rewriting them. Zero external dependency for the runtime; the
  coherence engine is fully mathematical, with no LLM.
type: software
